** regression test: realistic pull-out test (RILEM-like): the bar (28 T2D2 elements of 5 mm) is pulled out of a
** concrete block (CPE8R) bearing on the loaded face; bond-slip by the fib Model Code 2010 law; peak = tauMax p L_b
** realistic pull-out: concrete block 150 x 150 (plane strain section, thickness 150), Ø16 bar, bonded length
** 120 mm (x = 30..150), free length 20 mm; the block bears on the loaded face (x = 150); units N, mm
*material, name=linearelastic, id=concrete, provider=marmot
30000.0, 0.2

